dsh-plugin-custom-ui README · 自定义 CSS：自定义 CSS 通过 `<style>` 的 `textContent` 注入，追加在内置生成样式之后，因此可以覆盖大部分视觉规则。它是全局的，也可以加载外部资源；错误规则可能破坏布局。

- 留空表示不注入。
- 清除方式：把文本框清空后保存，或「恢复默认」。
- 常用场景：改字体间距、隐藏某个元素、微调某个 token、添加自己的 `body::before` 层。

例如：

```css
body {
  letter-spacing: 0.01em;
}

dsh-plugin-custom-ui README · dsh-plugin-custom-ui：- a full-window wallpaper from a solid color, CSS gradient, image URL, or browser-local image;
- an overlay, blur, and per-layer surface opacity to keep the interface readable;
- an accent color and a global radius scale;
- a global custom CSS escape hatch;
- live apply after saving, persistence across reloads/restarts, and one-click reset.

dsh-plugin-custom-ui README · Development：- bundle registration, exports, and defaults synced with `lib/defaults.js`;
- `normalizeSettings` defaults, clamping, and invalid color/URL/gradient fallbacks;
- `validateImageUrl` and `isValidGradient`;
- `buildRuntimeCss` wallpaper/overlay/blur/custom-CSS output;
- `buildTokenOverrides` paired light/dark values and independent accent/radius;
- `buildSettingsOps` base-aware set/unset and “only edited fields”;
- `validateSettings` errors/warnings;
- zh/en dictionary key parity;
- an `apply` wiring test with a mock context (section registration, styles, token
  overrides, dispose cleanup);
- a ready-branch render smoke test of the settings page, including the image URL field;
- package/patch checks and `node --check`.
